        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: Valid pairs are (1,1),(1,2)(1,1),(1,2)(1,1),(1,2) and (2,2)(2,2)(2,2).\nTest case 222: (1,1)(1,1)(1,1) is the only valid pair.\nTest case 333: Valid pairs are (1,1),(2,2)(1,1),(2,2)(1,1),(2,2) and (3,4)(3,4)(3,4)."
